<!-- Teaching layer over exact approved source fb8354e. -->
<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">A release is halted promptly, yet support reports continue from users who already installed it. Exposure control and recovery for installed clients are different operations.</p>

<!-- @before 4. Halting A Bad Release :: animation -->
### A halt leaves the installed binary in place

